999
Round 3 follow-up: a LINE with codes 10/20 and NO 11/21. libdxfrw
999
default-initialises the missing second point to (0,0,0) and exposes no
999
group-code-presence flag, so this arrived indistinguishable from a real line
999
drawn to the origin: a phantom entity, IMPORT OK, and a profile that opens.
999
Accepted as a limitation for two rounds because "detecting it needs a hook the
999
library does not offer" -- which stopped being true once ADR-M6-015 made the
999
reader read group codes for itself.
999
The three good lines plus the phantom would have formed a closed quadrilateral;
999
without the phantom the remaining three are an open chain, which is what the
999
file actually describes.
